abstract: "Self-contained Qiskit workflows for benchmarking native fusion readout against grouped Pauli sampling on Fibonacci-chain Hamiltonians across Floquet-evolution and locked-state VQE workloads, including IBM hardware submission, returned-job collection and reduction, dataset summarization, and manuscript-figure generation."
